SUMMARY:Pilates in The HIVE Pollinator Garden
DESCRIPTION:Build strength\, improve flexibility\, and reconnect with your body in this pilates mat class in the pollinator garden. This energizing\, full-body workout combines mindful movement\, core-focused exercises\, and controlled breathing to leave you feeling stronger\, balanced\, and refreshed. All ages and abilities welcome! \nAfter class\, each participant receives a refreshing glass of California Pomegranate Honey Hibiscus Cooler or a sparkling mead beverage. \nBring your yoga mat\, water and wear comfortable clothes. If the weather is too cool or too hot\, we’ll practice indoors\, among the honey drums. \nHosted in collaboration with locally-owned Club Pilates Gibson Plaza!
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/pilates-in-the-hive-pollinator-garden-2/
LOCATION:The HIVE Tasting Room and Kitchen\, 1221 Harter Ave\, Woodland\, CA\, 95776
CATEGORIES:Athletics
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/pilates.jpg
