SUMMARY:Sacramento Horror Film Festival Best of Shorts Edition 2026
DESCRIPTION:THE SACRAMENTO HORROR FILM FESTIVAL:\nBEST OF SHORTS\nONE SCREEN. ALL DAY. NO MERCY.\nOn October 10th\, the Sacramento Horror Film Festival hijacks the Historic Colonial Theatre for a full day of the short films that absolutely killed on our screen.\nFEATURING NEARLY TWO DECADES OF SHFF SHORTS.\nTHIS IS THE BEST OF SHORTS.\nAward winners. Audience favorites. Beautiful disasters. Nasty little nightmares. Monsters\, maniacs\, bloodsuckers\, weirdos\, creeps\, practical gore\, pitch black laughs and independent filmmakers with absolutely no adult supervision.\nNO FEATURES. NO FILLER. JUST SHORT FILMS ALL DAMN DAY.\nThese are the films that won trophies\, pissed people off\, made audiences howl\, made people squirm and earned their way back onto the big screen.\nAnd holding the whole beautiful mess together is your host SINDIE CHOPPER\, presiding over an entire day of cinematic bad behavior.\nShow up early. Stay late. Grab some popcorn. Have a drink. Make some questionable decisions.\n​\nSACRAMENTO HORROR FILM FESTIVAL\nBEST OF SHORTS\nSATURDAY • OCTOBER 10\, 2026  ·  12:30PM ‘TIL LATE\nHISTORIC COLONIAL THEATRE • SACRAMENTO\nThe full festival program will be announced September.\n💀AWARD WINNERS\n💀 AUDIENCE CHOICE FILMS\n💀 FESTIVAL FAVORITES\n💀 SHORT FILMS FROM OPEN TO CLOSE\nPasses are available now at LoveHorrorEvents.com and SacHorrorFilmFest.com! \n$25 to $30
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/sacramento-horror-film-festival-best-of-shorts-edition-2026/
LOCATION:Historical Colonial Theatre\, Sacramento
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/EXAV0d5gQUS-MF8ITivImg.large_.jpg
END:VEVENT
