UID:10085590-1791660600-1791669600@thedirt.online
SUMMARY:Rock of Ages
DESCRIPTION:It’s 1987 on Los Angeles’ legendary Sunset Strip\, where the Bourbon Room is the heart of the rock-and-roll scene. When aspiring musician Drew meets small-town newcomer Sherrie\, their dreams of love and stardom collide with a developer determined to transform the Strip. With the Bourbon Room fighting for survival and a legendary rock star headed to town\, this hilarious\, high-energy jukebox musical celebrates big dreams\, true love\, and the unforgettable spirit of ’80s rock\, all set to classic hits from Whitesnake\, Styx\, Pat Benatar\, Twisted Sister\, and more. It’s part rock concert\, part comedy\, part love letter to the ’80s…and completely ready to rock your socks off!!! \nGet Tickets: https://app.arts-people.com/index.php?show=315835 \nLearn More: https://www.woodlandoperahouse.org/rockofages.html \nShow Run: October 9-24\, 2026 \nWeek 1: Friday and Saturday at 7:30 p.m.\, Sunday at 2:00 p.m.\nWeek 2: Thursday and Friday at 7:30 p.m.\, Saturday at 2:00 and 7:30 p.m.\, Sunday at 2:00 p.m.\nWeek 3: Thursday and Friday at 7:30 p.m.\, Saturday at 2:00 and 7:30 p.m. \nRun Time: Approximately 2 hours plus a 15 minute intermission \nCONTENT WARNING: Rock of Ages is recommended for ages 13+ and contains strong language\, sexual references\, suggestive themes\, alcohol and drug references\, and mature situations.
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/rock-of-ages/2026-10-10/
LOCATION:Woodland Opera House\, 340 2nd Street\, Woodland\, California
CATEGORIES:Music,Stage & Dance
ORGANIZER;CN="Woodland Opera House":MAILTO:boxoffice@woodlandoperahouse.org
GEO:40.5161884;-79.8458488
