DESCRIPTION:The workshop will provide a general overview of U.S. Copyright
  Law\, with a focus on topics relevant to writing your thesis or dissertat
 ion. You’ll learn about copyright ownership of your work\, embargo optio
 ns\, and the UC Open Access Policies.\n\n \n\nRegister:\n\nZoom Registrati
 on\n\nIn-Person Registration
LOCATION:Walker Hall\, Gibeling Room or Zoom
URL:https://events.library.ucdavis.edu/event/workshop-copyright-and-your-d
 issertation
