BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"UC Davis CampusGroups": "https://aggielife.ucdavis.edu/rsvp?id=909546"}
X-SOURCE-ID:ucdavis_campusgroups
SUMMARY:Graduate Education Application Workspace
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261019T163000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261019T180000
UID:8435d9a05bdfb6b9a52392567ac17eef1062026_8:40:01_PM@campusgroups.com
DESCRIPTION:Applying to Graduate or Professional School This Fall?\n\nDon'
 t feel like you have enough time to get your applications done? Come work 
 on them with us.\n\nWe've reserved dedicated time and space for students w
 ho are applying to graduate and professional schools. You'll work alongsid
 e GSP\, EOP\, and USP students who are going through the same process—gi
 ving you time to focus\, get questions answered\, and make progress on you
 r applications.\n\nEach session gives you time to:\nSet a goal for what yo
 u want to accomplish that day\nWork on your applications with dedicated ti
 me and fewer distractions\nAsk questions and troubleshoot challenges as th
 ey come up\nShare ideas and problem-solve with other students going throug
 h the process\nMake progress on the application you've been putting off\n\
 nOn select days\, we'll also have Pre-Grad/Law Advising\, graduate and pro
 fessional students\, Graduate Studies representatives\, and other campus r
 esources available to provide guidance and answer questions.\n\nCome with 
 your laptop\, your application\, and a goal. We'll provide the time\, spac
 e\, support—and snacks.
LOCATION:South Hall\, Rm 114\, 162 E Quad Ave\, 16 South Hall\, Davis\, CA
  95616\, United States
URL:https://aggielife.ucdavis.edu/rsvp?id=909546
X-SOURCE:UC Davis CampusGroups
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Mindful Embodied Spirituality": "https://www.meetup.com/mindful-embodied-spirituality/events/316773587/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_mindful_embodied_spirituality
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Mindful Embodied Spirituality
UID:event_316773587@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261010T053143Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261019T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261019T200000
SUMMARY:Conscious Conversations & Somatic Practices  
DESCRIPTION:Iama Embodied Community\nThis is a spiritual community that ho
 nors the body’s wisdom and lived experience. Whether you’re healing fr
 om religious trauma\, deconstructing beliefs\, exploring spirituality\, or
  just want to be with other conscious persons\, this space is for you.\n\n
 Expect conscious conversations\, meditation\, breathwork\, sound healing\,
  and other somatic practices to help reconnect with ourselves and each oth
 er.\n\nwe share a potluck dinner every last Monday of the month.\n\n📅 *
 *Date & Time**: Mondays 6-8 PM\n📍 **Location**: 727 T St. Sacramento\, 
 Ca\, 95811\n💜 **All our events are free\, donations supported.**\n✨ *
 *No prior experience or spiritual beliefs necessary.**\n📩 **RSVP/ Quest
 ions? Reach out at** embody.iama@gmail.com\n🔗 **Follow us on Instagram:
 ** [@embody.iama](https://www.instagram.com/embody.iama)\n\nPS: we meet in
  the social hall of Parkview Presbyterian Church. Please find us through t
 he back entrance\, the brown gate on Solons alley. You may park in the bac
 k\, move the orange post to park and please return it when you leave.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/mindful-embodied-spirituality/events/
 316773587/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260930T012650Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260930T012650Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
