X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Mindful Embodied Spirituality": "https://www.meetup.com/mindful-embodied-spirituality/events/316806765/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_mindful_embodied_spirituality
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Mindful Embodied Spirituality
UID:event_316806765@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261010T053143Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261021T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261021T200000
SUMMARY:Grounded Together: Building Resilience\, Connection\, and Communit
 y
DESCRIPTION:Iama Embodied Community\n***P.S. this is part of a 5 week seri
 es\, though not required\, you are highly encouraged to attend all - No me
 eting on Oct 7***\n\nJoin **Rev. Rola Al-Ashkar** for a five-week journey 
 exploring how our life experiences shape the way we respond to stress\, co
 nflict\, belonging\, and relationships. Through storytelling\, guided refl
 ection\, and gentle body-centered (somatic) practices\, participants will 
 develop tools for greater self-awareness\, emotional resilience\, and comp
 assionate listening.\nWhether you're seeking personal growth\, healthier r
 elationships\, or a deeper sense of connection within our community\, this
  series offers a welcoming and supportive space. No prior experience is ne
 cessary. Please register using the following link: [[LINK](https://docs.go
 ogle.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdxWVImvnFcRLw5on8gH2WFGQfoMnVmNowpxZd9FHajblr2I
 w/viewform?usp=send_form)].\n**Wednesdays:** Sept. 16\, 23\, 30\; Oct. 14 
 & 21 6:00 – 8:00 pm
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/mindful-embodied-spirituality/events/
 316806765/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261002T010955Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261002T010955Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
