SUMMARY:Night with Industry
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261022T163000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261022T200000
UID:07b954f0d18ec052c3d81c0cee8ce5c8772026_2:24:07_AM@campusgroups.com
DESCRIPTION:Night with Industry (NWI) is an event hosted by the American I
 nstitute of Chemical Engineers (AIChE) at UC Davis that gives engineering 
 students the opportunity to network with representatives of various compan
 ies in a formal dinner setting. The event is split up into two components 
 on October 22\, Thursday. From 4:30-6 P.M. there is a career fair where st
 udents have the chance to talk to any of the company representatives at th
 eir respective booths. From 6-8 P.M. there is a sit-down dinner in which a
 ttendees will be seated with a company representative for further\, more p
 ersonal networking.
LOCATION:UC Davis Conference Center\, 1 Shields Ave\, Davis\, California 9
 5616\, United States
URL:https://aggielife.ucdavis.edu/rsvp?id=908921
X-SOURCE:UC Davis CampusGroups
END:VEVENT
