X-SOURCE-ID:ucdavis_campusgroups
SUMMARY:Graduate Education Application Workspace
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261026T163000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261026T180000
UID:65691a097e6b1ead7353f0114e9f05c81062026_8:40:02_PM@campusgroups.com
DESCRIPTION:Applying to Graduate or Professional School This Fall?\n\nDon'
 t feel like you have enough time to get your applications done? Come work 
 on them with us.\n\nWe've reserved dedicated time and space for students w
 ho are applying to graduate and professional schools. You'll work alongsid
 e GSP\, EOP\, and USP students who are going through the same process—gi
 ving you time to focus\, get questions answered\, and make progress on you
 r applications.\n\nEach session gives you time to:\nSet a goal for what yo
 u want to accomplish that day\nWork on your applications with dedicated ti
 me and fewer distractions\nAsk questions and troubleshoot challenges as th
 ey come up\nShare ideas and problem-solve with other students going throug
 h the process\nMake progress on the application you've been putting off\n\
 nOn select days\, we'll also have Pre-Grad/Law Advising\, graduate and pro
 fessional students\, Graduate Studies representatives\, and other campus r
 esources available to provide guidance and answer questions.\n\nCome with 
 your laptop\, your application\, and a goal. We'll provide the time\, spac
 e\, support—and snacks.
LOCATION:South Hall\, Rm 114\, 162 E Quad Ave\, 16 South Hall\, Davis\, CA
  95616\, United States
URL:https://aggielife.ucdavis.edu/rsvp?id=909547
X-SOURCE:UC Davis CampusGroups
END:VEVENT
