DESCRIPTION:Experience the heart and soul of Davis every Saturday at the 
 Davis Farmers Market in Central Park! \n🗓 Every Saturday⏰ 8:00 AM 
 – 1:00 PM📍 Central Park\, Davis \nShop fresh from the source with lo
 cal farmers and vendors offering: \n🥕 Fresh\, seasonal produce🌻 Farm
  products🛍 Handmade crafts🥖 Fresh-baked goods☕ Coffee and hot food
  \nWhether you’re stocking up on locally grown ingredients\, enjoying br
 eakfast in the park\, or simply soaking in the vibrant community atmospher
 e\, the Davis Farmers Market is a beloved weekly tradition for all ages. \
 nBring your family\, support local growers and makers\, and enjoy the boun
 ty of our fertile region every Saturday!
LOCATION:Central Park\, 301 C St.\, Davis\, CA\, 95616\, United States
URL:https://davisdowntown.com/event/davis-farmers-market-every-saturday-fr
 om-8am-1pm/2026-10-31/
X-SOURCE:Davis Downtown
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Davis Downtown": "https://davisdowntown.com/event/zombie-bike-parade/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:davis_downtown
SUMMARY:Zombie Bike Parade
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261031T040000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261031T053000
UID:10002205-1793444400-1793449800@davisdowntown.com
DESCRIPTION:The Zombie Bike Parade Everyone is welcome at Community Park f
 or the festival: on foot\, on any wheels\, in a wheelchair or powerchair\,
  or pushing a stroller. The official bike parade is different. It rides ju
 st under five miles at a regular biking pace\, so it is for bicycles (incl
 uding e-bikes\, cargo bikes\, tandems and bike trailers) and only for ride
 rs who can keep that pace for the whole route. Helmets are required under 
 18 and strongly encouraged for everyone. If the parade is not the right fi
 t\, stay at Community Park: the shows\, the entertainment stations and the
  2:30 p.m. skydiving finale all happen there.
LOCATION:Community Park\, 203 E 14th St\, Davis\, CA\, 95616\, United Stat
 es
URL:https://davisdowntown.com/event/zombie-bike-parade/
X-SOURCE:Davis Downtown
END:VEVENT
