SUMMARY:Workshop: Mastering Your Literature Search: Techniques\, Tools and
  AI
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261106T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261106T130000
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_53949262091866
DESCRIPTION:This workshop is ideal for any student or researcher embarking
  on a literature search or review\, or anyone wanting to learn about emerg
 ing AI tools for literature searching. The session will cover (1) how to t
 ranslate your research question into a search strategy that will uncover t
 he scholarly literature you need\, (2) the library tools you will need for
  your searches\, and (3) an introduction to the AI tools designed for lite
 rature searching and how they can supplement your search strategy.\n\n \n\
 nRegister:\n\nZoom Registration\n\nIn-Person Registration
LOCATION:Walker Hall\, Gibeling Room or Zoom
URL:https://events.library.ucdavis.edu/event/workshop-mastering-your-liter
 ature-search
